t", "title": "Idea logs"}], "description": "Gist: Sketching gives uncertain ideas a visible form so they can be tested, compared, and improved."}, {"id": "e4c5b746-5d4c-4e72-9d69-f0cbe706130c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Drawing to communicate", "children": [{"id": "e795f7e3-bb19-49b8-811e-f5aa4343bf18", "type": "concept", "title": "Intent and audience"}, {"id": "9538305c-e312-4915-aaff-e23712f0bd7d", "type": "concept", "title": "Visual clarity"}, {"id": "d30543ce-4489-4a04-bbce-769d3477ff43", "type": "concept", "title": "Annotation"}, {"id": "8f306280-8c33-49eb-9d1b-0d3881191cf9", "type": "concept", "title": "Drawing as explanation"}], "description": "Gist: Design drawing translates private thinking into shared information for peers, clients, instructors, and collaborators."}]}, {"id": "8c6e7414-3272-4e85-b444-f936f5bd4f63", "type": "topic", "title": "Materials, Tools, and Studio Habits", "description": "Build confident control of analog and digital tools while developing disciplined sketchbook, critique, and documentation habits.", "children": [{"id": "29a9c022-b2f1-474e-9d8c-1c2f4340fe0f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Analog tool control", "children": [{"id": "eb7fc72b-fcf0-442d-880f-e1d80deec34a", "type": "concept", "title": "Graphite grades"}, {"id": "a1503b42-0bd6-4a71-ad64-5ea070ddb024", "type": "concept", "title": "Charcoal and conte"}, {"id": "2a161432-9a77-47d4-95e8-ea7dc320fe3f", "type": "concept", "title": "Ink pens and brushes"}, {"id": "1c17b493-ee10-446c-8905-9e94d5ddf7f8", "type": "concept", "title": "Paper tooth and weight"}], "description": "Gist: Students learn how different drawing materials behave so technique becomes intentional rather than accidental."}, {"id": "1c01af05-9c05-4cf2-b2d8-f8955d0f5278", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Studio process habits", "children": [{"id": "59b5846c-7f23-4537-8d46-ca6e322ca649", "type": "concept", "title": "Sketchbook routines"}, {"id": "8ed52799-241a-4018-8bfd-5e03ed15a7b9", "type": "concept", "title": "Date and label systems"}, {"id": "bf8a40c6-85df-411c-a232-b9a7c4862aa3", "type": "concept", "title": "Process notes"}, {"id": "b57e35a6-2d93-4a50-9957-63d40e84392a", "type": "concept", "title": "Daily warmups"}], "description": "Gist: A strong foundation course depends on regular practice, reflection, organization, and revision."}, {"id": "ae7d654b-8d63-44d0-8c91-787dcdb0b496", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Care, safety, and presentation", "children": [{"id": "245ce8cb-d3d6-40ac-b753-391408e61993", "type": "concept", "title": "Clean edges"}, {"id": "3ca7b7fc-7300-4698-8efc-a1c06f1b5ac9", "type": "concept", "title": "Fixative and storage"}, {"id": "e1e78d85-d681-41d9-a211-766562b6dbd3", "type": "concept", "title": "Workspace etiquette"}, {"id": "3ba63c28-f328-40db-a175-c84dcb4692ee", "type": "concept", "title": "Submission standards"}], "description": "Gist: Professional habits make work easier to review, archive, transport, and develop over time."}]}, {"id": "c24c40da-44c4-4041-91b7-9fb8c8f6ba4f", "type": "topic", "title": "Line, Gesture, and Mark-Making", "description": "Use line as a living design language for energy, structure, rhythm, emphasis, and expressive intent.", "children": [{"id": "2c648653-b996-4189-9504-79f9f5d31020", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Line quality", "children": [{"id": "3e6dcf5b-cde7-4f93-bbef-3da7de54b116", "type": "concept", "title": "Weight variation"}, {"id": "3e8f2160-d2d2-4691-aac9-04048cecf7d2", "type": "concept", "title": "Continuous line"}, {"id": "f1a3ca36-f880-4153-97bd-db35d96ec895", "type": "concept", "title": "Lost and found line"}, {"id": "fde7d08c-9368-4db1-8bd5-8c4a22d92837", "type": "concept", "title": "Line economy"}], "description": "Gist: Line is not just outline; it carries speed, pressure, hierarchy, confidence, and attention."}, {"id": "40952bcd-3dd7-490f-af37-6c49ca638e23", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Gesture drawing", "children": [{"id": "b14ea217-e72d-47f5-992c-cb1498307b90", "type": "concept", "title": "Action 