ize observation, construction, ideation, communication, and revision in a coherent final drawing series.", "children": [{"id": "fec59331-474a-409a-b70a-b805da6edf97", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Project proposal", "children": [{"id": "2094cc18-03aa-4a43-9de0-de3c87e9df75", "type": "concept", "title": "Theme statement"}, {"id": "71511145-4f43-4b46-8c6f-d4f8a04a1e61", "type": "concept", "title": "Audience and context"}, {"id": "440fa653-c4f8-4db9-809a-f9c25d36049b", "type": "concept", "title": "Source references"}, {"id": "829bd160-f178-412c-ad9f-fd7bb022052a", "type": "concept", "title": "Milestones"}], "description": "Gist: The capstone begins with a focused design question and a plan for visual investigation."}, {"id": "352bd39b-5ea9-4e83-8f5a-4b6dd50c4bea", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Series development", "children": [{"id": "f0626edb-716e-4ba3-84d0-66f4083785ac", "type": "concept", "title": "Consistent format"}, {"id": "bf0b7064-008d-4b2e-801e-3a3e8469c0bb", "type": "concept", "title": "Linked studies"}, {"id": "462c0381-e677-4644-a4dc-c21388f525ca", "type": "concept", "title": "Material choices"}, {"id": "1e7da83d-ba49-41a2-bdcb-a40516aa8ebc", "type": "concept", "title": "Midpoint critique"}], "description": "Gist: A series asks students to sustain visual language while showing variation and depth."}, {"id": "b965683a-bc9a-4cd5-84df-fce5e5e4b456", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Final review", "children": [{"id": "51be9003-bc39-4611-aa7d-659977df64bc", "type": "concept", "title": "Resolved drawings"}, {"id": "aa473013-b1fb-4382-a817-8d79c641b027", "type": "concept", "title": "Process archive"}, {"id": "51b0b02b-1374-4ffd-8720-bc1819849d7e", "type": "concept", "title": "Oral presentation"}, {"id": "67b9e0df-21a8-414a-9163-0a07ecad64d9", "type": "concept", "title": "Revision reflection"}], "description": "Gist: The final review tests craft, concept, presentation, process, and the student's ability to discuss choices."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$drfdjson$::jsonb,
