  title = 'Drawing for Designers (Foundation)',
  goal = 'Drawing for Designers (Foundation)',
  summary = 'Frame drawing as a way to observe, question, test, communicate, and make design decisions before finished form. Students build analog and digital tool control and studio habits, then practice line and gesture, contour and accuracy, form and volume, value and light, perspective, page structure, proportion, texture, diagramming, color and mixed media, lettering and layout, hybrid workflows, research-led iteration, critique vocabulary, portfolio documentation, and a capstone drawing series.',
